after pass 3: 1 2 3 9 6 4 8
after pass 4: 1 2 3 4 6 9 8
after pass 5: 1 2 3 4 6 9 8
after pass 6: 1 2 3 4 6 8 9
after pass 7: 1 2 3 4 6 8 9` },
