        { type: "p", text: "The inner loop does n−1, then n−2, …, then 1 comparison: a total of n(n−1)/2. Selection sort performs this work on **every** input, so best, average, and worst case are all Θ(n²). It does at most n−1 swaps, one per outer iteration, which is useful when writes are expensive." },
